  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Summary:<br><br>Escape to The Lookout, a brand new coastal chic home offering stunning Gulf views and luxurious amenities. This 4-bedroom, 4.5-bathroom home sleeps up to 12 with 2 king suites,1 queen bedroom,1 bunkroom w/4 twins and 1 queen sleeper sofa.It also features a rooftop deck with a hot tub, outdoor seating, a gas grill, and a big-screen TV – perfect for entertaining. Enjoy close proximity to restaurants, coffee shops, boutiques, and a quick 5-minute walk to the beach and Rosemary for the ultimate vacation experience.<br><br><br><br>The Space:<br><br>With the convenient new underground pedestrian tunnel, reaching 30A is a breeze, and the community pool is ready for your enjoyment.<br><br><br><br>Guest Access:<br><br>This is a whole house rental, so you'll have complete access to all areas. This includes the bedrooms, bathrooms, kitchen, living room, outdoor seating areas, backyard, and amenities such as the hot tub, community pool, and access to the beach.<br><br><br><br>The Neighborhood:<br><br>Explore the vibrant communities surrounding our property! You'll find a variety of dining and shopping options within easy reach. In Inlet Beach, enjoy delicious meals at Amici 30A Italian Kitchen, Amigos 30A Mexican Kitchen, or Big Bad Breakfast. For a sweet treat, visit The Donut Hole. Nearby, Rosemary Beach offers Cowgirl Kitchen, Edward’s, and Restaurant Paradis, along with unique shops like The Hidden Lantern Bookstore. Seacrest Beach (The Village of South Walton) has Golden Seashell Beach Store, Grits & Grind Breakfast, and Pizza by the Sea. Alys Beach offers upscale dining at Caliza and George’s. Discover the charm of each village along 30A, a scenic route connecting Destin and Panama City Beach, known for its rare dune lakes and stunning beaches.<br><br><br><br>Getting Around:<br><br>Enjoy easy access to the beach, dining, and shopping! Our home is conveniently located within a 5-minute drive of beach access, restaurants, shops, and coffee spots, as well as the charming Rosemary Beach. The Inlet Beach Pedestrian Underpass, opening, will provide direct beach access via a ramp and stairs.<br><br><br><br>Other Things to Note:<br><br>Please note: Any beach chairs, umbrellas, toys, coolers, pack n plays, and baby gear available are provided as a complimentary amenity. LUXE 30A does not guarantee the inclusion or perfect working order of these items. They are not part of the rental agreement.<br><br>The primary renter must be 25 years of age or older, with at least one guest aged 25+ for every three guests in the group.<br><br><br><br>Interaction with Guests:<br><br>We are available to assist you throughout your stay! You can reach us via your chosen platform with any questions or concerns. We typically respond within a few hours, but rest assured—we’ll do our best to get back to you as quickly as possible. For urgent matters, please note it in your message. We’re committed to ensuring you have a fantastic vacation experience!",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "Luxury Beach House: Rooftop Jacuzzi & Family Fun"
        }
      ],
